# Public Supabase client settings for local development (npm run dev).
# These are the PUBLIC anon key + project URL — the same values every page of the
# live site ships to the browser — so they are safe to commit. Never put the
# service-role key or any server secret here. .env.local overrides these.
#
# Mock mode (no backend) is NOT switched on here, so it can't affect anyone by
# default. To use it, add NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_API=1 to your own .env.local.
